    {
      "entryId": "tit-2-13",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Looking for that blessed hope and the glorious appearing of the great God and our Saviour Jesus Christ. First principle: Christian ethics are sustained by eschatological hope.",
