    {
      "entryId": "tit-2-11",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Grace appeared to all men, and it teaches. First principle: grace is pedagogical — the appearing One trains denial, sobriety, and righteousness while we await the blessed hope.",
