    {
      "entryId": "tit-2-14",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Redemption from iniquity into a zealous purified people. First principle: the self-gift purifies and possesses — Exodus 19's peculiar treasure is bought back by Isaiah 53's bleeding Servant.",
      "density": 1.8429,
