    {
      "entryId": "tit-3-4",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The appearing of kindness is the turning point of the saved. First principle: salvation's origin is God's kindness appearing, not human goodness preceding — not by works, according to mercy.",
